ury','BMDC-10002',2,800.00,'Sun,Mon,Tue,Wed,Thu','16:00:00','20:00:00',25,'MBBS (SSMC), MD (Pulmonology). Senior Consultant Chest Specialist with expertise in chronic bronchial asthma, COPD, and post-viral pulmonary fibrosis.'),(7,'BMDC-10003','Dr. Shakil Hossain','Dermatology','+8801711000003','dr.shakil@xmed.gov.bd','$2a$10$zyhzj4bJ73aOQjR/.OvzDe5m8qq2toiyGx0V676LUC.FKje15idO6',1,'2026-08-26 19:40:48','DOC-1003','Dr. Shakil Hossain','BMDC-10003',3,600.00,'Sat,Mon,Wed,Fri','10:00:00','18:00:00',30,'MBBS (DMC), DDV, FCPS (Dermatology). Renowned clinical dermatologist specializing in chronic psoriasis, allergic dermatitis, and modern phototherapy.'),(8,'BMDC-10004','Dr. Farzana Kabir','Pediatrics','+8801711000004','dr.farzana@xmed.gov.bd','$2a$10$zyhzj4bJ73aOQjR/.OvzDe5m8qq2toiyGx0V676LUC.FKje15idO6',1,'2026-08-26 19:40:48','DOC-1004','Dr. Farzana Kabir','BMDC-10004',4,1200.00,'Sat,Sun,Tue,Thu','09:00:00','13:00:00',20,'MBBS (DMC), DCH, FCPS (Pediatrics). Consultant Pediatrician specializing in neonatal developmental care, pediatric immunization, and acute febrile management.'),(9,'BMDC-10005','Dr. Mahmudul Hasan','General Surgery','+8801711000005','dr.mahmudul@xmed.gov.bd','$2a$10$zyhzj4bJ73aOQjR/.OvzDe5m8qq2toiyGx0V676LUC.FKje15idO6',1,'2026-08-26 19:40:48','DOC-1005','Dr. Mahmudul Hasan','BMDC-10005',5,900.00,'Sat,Sun,Mon,Tue,Wed','10:00:00','18:00:00',15,'MBBS (SOMC), MS (General Surgery), FRCS (Glasgow). 18+ years operating experience in minimally invasive laparoscopic abdominal and gastrointestinal procedures.'),(10,'BMDC-10006','Dr. Sharmin Akter','Orthopedics','+8801711000006','dr.sharmin@xmed.gov.bd','$2a$10$zyhzj4bJ73aOQjR/.OvzDe5m8qq2toiyGx0V676LUC.FKje15idO6',1,'2026-08-26 19:40:48','DOC-1006','Dr. Sharmin Akter','BMDC-10006',6,800.00,'Sat,Sun,Mon,Wed,Thu','16:00:00','20:00:00',20,'MBBS (CMC), MS (Orthopedics). Specialist trauma surgeon and joint preservation expert focusing on arthroscopic knee repair and geriatric osteoporosis.'),(11,'BMDC-10007','Dr. K