st today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',0,'2026-08-15 19:26:07'),(229,'BD-2000-0011','DOC-1014','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-25 17:11:07'),(230,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0011','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-25 17:56:07'),(231,'BD-2000-0011','DOC-1014','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-25 18:41:07'),(232,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0011','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-25 19:26:07'),(233,'BD-2000-0011','DOC-1014','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-25 20:11:07'),(234,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0011','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-25 20:56:07'),(235,'BD-2000-0011','DOC-1015','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-22 17:11:07'),(236,'DOC-1015','BD-2000-0011','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-22 17:56:07'),(237,'BD-2000-0011','DOC-1015','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-22 18:41:07'),(238,'DOC-1015','BD-2000-0011','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-22 19:26:07'),(239,'BD-2000-0012','DOC-1014','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-14 17:12:07'),(240,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0012','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2