-0017','DOC-1012','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-22 18:47:07'),(361,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0017','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-22 19:32:07'),(362,'BD-2000-0017','DOC-1012','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-22 20:17:07'),(363,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0017','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-22 21:02:07'),(364,'BD-2000-0017','DOC-1013','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-19 17:17:07'),(365,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0017','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-19 18:02:07'),(366,'BD-2000-0017','DOC-1013','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-19 18:47:07'),(367,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0017','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-19 19:32:07'),(368,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1012','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-24 17:18:07'),(369,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0018','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-24 18:03:07'),(370,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1012','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-24 18:48:07'),(371,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0018','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-24 19:33:07'),(372,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1013','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-21 17:18:07'),(373,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0018','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-21 18:03:07'),(374,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1013','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-21 18:48:07'),(375,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0018','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',0,'2026-08-21 19:33:07'),(376,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1014','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 mg/dL. I have started Atorvastatin 10mg nightly.',1,'2026-08-18 17:18:07'),(377,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0018','Atorvastatin works best when taken at bedtime to target peak hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Continue taking it nightly.',1,'2026-08-18 18:03:07'),(378,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1014','Should I be concerned about muscle soreness or liver enzymes?',1,'2026-08-18 18:48:07'),(379,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0018','Mild fatigue is rare, but report any severe unexplained muscle cramps. We will recheck liver enzymes and lipid levels in 8 weeks.',1,'2026-08-18 19:33:07'),(380,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1015','Dr. Tanvir, I get throbbing one-sided headaches preceded by bright zigzag lines in my visual field.',1,'2026-08-15 17:18:07'),(381,'DOC-1015','BD-2000-0018','These are classic migraine episodes with aura. Take Naproxen 500mg immediately when the visual aura begins, before the pain peaks.',1,'2026-08-15 18:03:07'),(382,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1015','Should I avoid specific dietary triggers like aged cheese or caffeine?',1,'2026-08-15 18:48:07'),(383,'DOC-1015','BD-2000-0018','Yes, maintain a regular sleep schedule, stay hydrated, and note down food triggers in your daily health journal.',1,'2026-08-15 19:33:07'),(384,'BD-2000-0018','DOC-1016','Doctor, my TSH is 5.8 mIU/L on Levothyroxine 50mcg. I still feel unusually cold and sluggish in the morning.',1,'2026-08-25 17:18:07'),(385,'DOC-1016','BD-2000-0018','Your dose requires a slight adjustment. Increase Levothyroxine to 75mcg daily, taken with p