DOC-1011','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-16 17:23:07'),(494,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0023','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-16 18:08:07'),(495,'BD-2000-0023','DOC-1011','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-16 18:53:07'),(496,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0023','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-16 19:38:07'),(497,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1010','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-21 17:24:07'),(498,'DOC-1010','BD-2000-0024','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-21 18:09:07'),(499,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1010','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-21 18:54:07'),(500,'DOC-1010','BD-2000-0024','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-21 19:39:07'),(501,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1011','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-18 17:24:07'),(502,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0024','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-18 18:09:07'),(503,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1011','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-18 18:54:07'),(504,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0024','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',0,'2026-08-18 19:39:07'),(505,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1012','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 mg/dL. I have started Atorvastatin 10mg nightly.',1,'2026-08-15 17:24:07'),(506,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0024','Atorvastatin works best when taken at bedtime to target peak hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Continue taking it nightly.',1,'2026-08-15 18:09:07'),(507,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1012','Should I be concerned about muscle soreness or liver enzymes?',1,'2026-08-15 18:54:07'),(508,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0024','Mild fatigue is rare, but report any severe unexplained muscle cramps. We will recheck liver enzymes and lipid levels in 8 weeks.',1,'2026-08-15 19:39:07'),(509,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1013','Dr. Tanvir, I get throbbing one-sided headaches preceded by bright zigzag lines in my visual field.',1,'2026-08-25 17:24:07'),(510,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0024','These are classic migraine episodes with aura. Take Naproxen 500mg immediately when the visual aura begins, before the pain peaks.',1,'2026-08-25 18:09:07'),(511,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1013','Should I avoid specific dietary triggers like aged cheese or caffeine?',1,'2026-08-25 18:54:07'),(512,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0024','Yes, maintain a regular sleep schedule, stay hydrated, and note down food triggers in your daily health journal.',1,'2026-08-25 19:39:07'),(513,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1014','Doctor, my TSH is 5.8 mIU/L on Levothyroxine 50mcg. I still feel unusually cold and sluggish in the morning.',1,'2026-08-22 17:24:07'),(514,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0024','Your dose requires a slight adjustment. Increase Levothyroxine to 75mcg daily, taken with plain water 45 minutes before breakfast.',1,'2026-08-22 18:09:07'),(515,'BD-2000-0024','DOC-1014','Can I take my calcium and vitamin D tablets together with the thyroid pill?',1,'2026-08-22 18:54:07'),(516,'DOC-1014','BD-2000-0024','No, calcium binds to thyroxine and blocks absorption. Separate calcium supplements by at least 4 hours.',0,'2026-08-22 19:39:07'),(517,'BD-2000-0025','DOC-1013','Good morning Doctor, I have been taking Amlodipine 5mg for 4 days as prescribed, but feel slightly lightheaded around noon. Sh