nutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-26 19:44:07'),(626,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1008','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-18 17:30:07'),(627,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0030','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-18 18:15:07'),(628,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1008','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-18 19:00:07'),(629,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0030','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-18 19:45:07'),(630,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1009','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-15 17:30:07'),(631,'DOC-1009','BD-2000-0030','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-15 18:15:07'),(632,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1009','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-15 19:00:07'),(633,'DOC-1009','BD-2000-0030','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',0,'2026-08-15 19:45:07'),(634,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1010','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 mg/dL. I have started Atorvastatin 10mg nightly.',1,'2026-08-25 17:30:07'),(635,'DOC-1010','BD-2000-0030','Atorvastatin works best when taken at bedtime to target peak hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Continue taking it nightly.',1,'2026-08-25 18:15:07'),(636,'BD-2000-0030','DOC-1010','Should I be concerned about muscle soreness or liver enzymes?',1,'2026-08-25 19:00:07'),(637,'DOC-1010','BD-2000-0030','Mild fatigue is rare, but report any severe unexplained muscle cramps. We will recheck liver enzymes and lipid levels in 8 weeks.',1,