 like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-15 19:06:07'),(758,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0036','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-15 19:51:07'),(759,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1007','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-25 17:36:07'),(760,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0036','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-25 18:21:07'),(761,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1007','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-25 19:06:07'),(762,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0036','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',0,'2026-08-25 19:51:07'),(763,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1008','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 mg/dL. I have started Atorvastatin 10mg nightly.',1,'2026-08-22 17:36:07'),(764,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0036','Atorvastatin works best when taken at bedtime to target peak hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Continue taking it nightly.',1,'2026-08-22 18:21:07'),(765,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1008','Should I be concerned about muscle soreness or liver enzymes?',1,'2026-08-22 19:06:07'),(766,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0036','Mild fatigue is rare, but report any severe unexplained muscle cramps. We will recheck liver enzymes and lipid levels in 8 weeks.',1,'2026-08-22 19:51:07'),(767,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1009','Dr. Tanvir, I get throbbing one-sided headaches preceded by bright zigzag lines in my visual field.',1,'2026-08-19 17:36:07'),(768,'DOC-1009','BD-2000-0036','These are classic migraine episodes with aura. Take Naproxen 500mg immediately when the visual aura begins, before the pain peaks.',1,'2026-08-19 18:21:07'),(769,'BD-2000-0036','DOC-1009','Should I avoid specific dietary triggers like aged cheese or caffeine?',1,'2026-08-19 19:06:07'),(770,'DOC-1009','BD-2