p?',1,'2026-08-23 19:11:07'),(877,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0041','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-23 19:56:07'),(878,'BD-2000-0041','DOC-1004','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-23 20:41:07'),(879,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0041','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-23 21:26:07'),(880,'BD-2000-0041','DOC-1005','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-20 17:41:07'),(881,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0041','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-20 18:26:07'),(882,'BD-2000-0041','DOC-1005','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-20 19:11:07'),(883,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0041','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-20 19:56:07'),(884,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1004','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-25 17:42:07'),(885,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0042','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-25 18:27:07'),(886,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1004','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-25 19:12:07'),(887,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0042','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-25 19:57:07'),(888,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1005','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-22 17:42:07'),(889,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0042','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-22 18:27:07'),(890,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1005','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-22 19:12:07'),(891,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0042','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',0,'2026-08-22 19:57:07'),(892,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1006','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 mg/dL. I have started Atorvastatin 10mg nightly.',1,'2026-08-19 17:42:07'),(893,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0042','Atorvastatin works best when taken at bedtime to target peak hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Continue taking it nightly.',1,'2026-08-19 18:27:07'),(894,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1006','Should I be concerned about muscle soreness or liver enzymes?',1,'2026-08-19 19:12:07'),(895,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0042','Mild fatigue is rare, but report any severe unexplained muscle cramps. We will recheck liver enzymes and lipid levels in 8 weeks.',1,'2026-08-19 19:57:07'),(896,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1007','Dr. Tanvir, I get throbbing one-sided headaches preceded by bright zigzag lines in my visual field.',1,'2026-08-16 17:42:07'),(897,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0042','These are classic migraine episodes with aura. Take Naproxen 500mg immediately when the visual aura begins, before the pain peaks.',1,'2026-08-16 18:27:07'),(898,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1007','Should I avoid specific dietary triggers like aged cheese or caffeine?',1,'2026-08-16 19:12:07'),(899,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0042','Yes, maintain a regular sleep schedule, stay hydrated, and note down food triggers in your daily health journal.',1,'2026-08-16 19:57:07'),(900,'BD-2000-0042','DOC-1008','Doctor, my TSH is 5.8 mIU/L on Levothyroxine 50mcg. I still feel unusually cold and sluggish in the morning.',1,'2026-08-26 17:42:07'),(901,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0042','Your dose requires a slight adjustment. Increase Levothyroxine to 75mcg daily, taken with plain water 45 minutes before breakfast.',1,'2026-08-26 18:27:07'),(902,'BD-2000-