0-0047','Yes, please complete an HbA1c and serum creatinine test next week, then upload the PDF report directly to your xMED vault.',1,'2026-08-26 20:02:07'),(998,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1020','Will do Doctor, uploaded last month’s lipid panel as well.',1,'2026-08-26 20:47:07'),(999,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1001','Hello Doctor, I developed a sudden fever of 102°F yesterday with retro-orbital eye pain and severe body ache. Could this be dengue?',1,'2026-08-23 17:47:07'),(1000,'DOC-1001','BD-2000-0047','Given seasonal trends, do NOT take any Ibuprofen or Aspirin. Take only Paracetamol 500mg up to every 6 hours and drink plenty of ORS and coconut water.',1,'2026-08-23 18:32:07'),(1001,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1001','Should I get a Complete Blood Count (CBC) and Dengue NS1 antigen test done today?',1,'2026-08-23 19:17:07'),(1002,'DOC-1001','BD-2000-0047','Yes, get a CBC and NS1 antigen test today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',0,'2026-08-23 20:02:07'),(1003,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1002','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-20 17:47:07'),(1004,'DOC-1002','BD-2000-0047','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-20 18:32:07'),(1005,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1002','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-20 19:17:07'),(1006,'DOC-1002','BD-2000-0047','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-20 20:02:07'),(1007,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1002','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-20 20:47:07'),(1008,'DOC-1002','BD-2000-0047','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-20 21:32:07'),(1009,'BD-2000-0047','DOC-1003','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night an