yroid pill?',1,'2026-08-21 19:22:07'),(1118,'DOC-1018','BD-2000-0052','No, calcium binds to thyroxine and blocks absorption. Separate calcium supplements by at least 4 hours.',1,'2026-08-21 20:07:07'),(1119,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1017','Good morning Doctor, I have been taking Amlodipine 5mg for 4 days as prescribed, but feel slightly lightheaded around noon. Should I adjust the timing?',1,'2026-08-26 17:53:07'),(1120,'DOC-1017','BD-2000-0053','Hello! Mild lightheadedness can happen initially as peripheral vascular resistance drops. Please check your blood pressure at noon and take the tablet right after breakfast with a glass of water.',1,'2026-08-26 18:38:07'),(1121,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1017','Understood Doctor. Should I strictly restrict dietary salt, and are 30-minute morning brisk walks safe?',1,'2026-08-26 19:23:07'),(1122,'DOC-1017','BD-2000-0053','Keep sodium under 2g daily. Moderate walks are safe and strongly encouraged. If systolic drops below 100 mmHg, message me immediately.',1,'2026-08-26 20:08:07'),(1123,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1018','Doctor, my fasting blood glucose was 7.8 mmol/L and 2-hour post-meal was 11.2 mmol/L. I am taking Metformin 500mg twice daily.',1,'2026-08-23 17:53:07'),(1124,'DOC-1018','BD-2000-0053','Thank you for tracking. Since post-prandial remains above our 8.5 target, ensure you take Metformin with meals and minimize refined carbohydrates in your evening diet.',1,'2026-08-23 18:38:07'),(1125,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1018','Should I schedule an HbA1c and kidney function test before our upcoming clinic review?',1,'2026-08-23 19:23:07'),(1126,'DOC-1018','BD-2000-0053','Yes, please complete an HbA1c and serum creatinine test next week, then upload the PDF report directly to your xMED vault.',1,'2026-08-23 20:08:07'),(1127,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1018','Will do Doctor, uploaded last month’s lipid panel as well.',1,'2026-08-23 20:53:07'),(1128,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1019','Hello Doctor, I developed a sudden fever of 102°F yesterday with retro-orbital eye pain and severe body ache. Could this be dengue?',1,'2026-08-20 17:53:07'),(1129,'DOC-1019','BD-2000-0053','Given seasonal trends, do NOT take any Ibuprofen or Aspirin. Take only Paracetamol 500mg up to every 6 hours and drink plenty of ORS and coconut water.',1,'2026-08-20 18:38:07'),(1130,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1019','Should I get a Complete Blood Count (CBC) and Dengue NS1 antigen test done today?',1,'2026-08-20 19:23:07'),(1131,'DOC-1019','BD-2000-0053','Yes, get a CBC and NS1 antigen test today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',0,'2026-08-20 20:08:07'),(1132,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1020','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-17 17:53:07'),(1133,'DOC-1020','BD-2000-0053','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-17 18:38:07'),(1134,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1020','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-17 19:23:07'),(1135,'DOC-1020','BD-2000-0053','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-17 20:08:07'),(1136,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1020','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-17 20:53:07'),(1137,'DOC-1020','BD-2000-0053','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-17 21:38:07'),(1138,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1001','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-14 17:53:07'),(1139,'DOC-1001','BD-2000-0053','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-14 18:38:07'),(1140,'BD-2000-0053','DOC-1001','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-14 19:23:07'),(1141