ntigen test done today?',1,'2026-08-25 19:39:07'),(1475,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0069','Yes, get a CBC and NS1 antigen test today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',1,'2026-08-25 20:24:07'),(1476,'BD-2000-0069','DOC-1008','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-22 18:09:07'),(1477,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0069','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-22 18:54:07'),(1478,'BD-2000-0069','DOC-1008','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-22 19:39:07'),(1479,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0069','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-22 20:24:07'),(1480,'BD-2000-0069','DOC-1008','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-22 21:09:07'),(1481,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0069','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-22 21:54:07'),(1482,'BD-2000-0069','DOC-1009','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-19 18:09:07'),(1483,'DOC-1009','BD-2000-0069','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-19 18:54:07'),(1484,'BD-2000-0069','DOC-1009','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-19 19:39:07'),(1485,'DOC-1009','BD-2000-0069','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',0,'2026-08-19 20:24:07'),(1486,'BD-2000-0070','DOC-1008','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-24 18:10:07'),(1487,'DOC-1008','BD-2000-0070'