 30-minute morning brisk walks safe?',1,'2026-08-15 19:45:07'),(1595,'DOC-1003','BD-2000-0075','Keep sodium under 2g daily. Moderate walks are safe and strongly encouraged. If systolic drops below 100 mmHg, message me immediately.',1,'2026-08-15 20:30:07'),(1596,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1004','Doctor, my fasting blood glucose was 7.8 mmol/L and 2-hour post-meal was 11.2 mmol/L. I am taking Metformin 500mg twice daily.',1,'2026-08-25 18:15:07'),(1597,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0075','Thank you for tracking. Since post-prandial remains above our 8.5 target, ensure you take Metformin with meals and minimize refined carbohydrates in your evening diet.',1,'2026-08-25 19:00:07'),(1598,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1004','Should I schedule an HbA1c and kidney function test before our upcoming clinic review?',1,'2026-08-25 19:45:07'),(1599,'DOC-1004','BD-2000-0075','Yes, please complete an HbA1c and serum creatinine test next week, then upload the PDF report directly to your xMED vault.',1,'2026-08-25 20:30:07'),(1600,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1004','Will do Doctor, uploaded last month’s lipid panel as well.',0,'2026-08-25 21:15:07'),(1601,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1005','Hello Doctor, I developed a sudden fever of 102°F yesterday with retro-orbital eye pain and severe body ache. Could this be dengue?',1,'2026-08-22 18:15:07'),(1602,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0075','Given seasonal trends, do NOT take any Ibuprofen or Aspirin. Take only Paracetamol 500mg up to every 6 hours and drink plenty of ORS and coconut water.',1,'2026-08-22 19:00:07'),(1603,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1005','Should I get a Complete Blood Count (CBC) and Dengue NS1 antigen test done today?',1,'2026-08-22 19:45:07'),(1604,'DOC-1005','BD-2000-0075','Yes, get a CBC and NS1 antigen test today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',1,'2026-08-22 20:30:07'),(1605,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1006','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-19 18:15:07'),(1606,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0075','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-19 19:00:07'),(1607,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1006','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-19 19:45:07'),(1608,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0075','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-19 20:30:07'),(1609,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1006','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-19 21:15:07'),(1610,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0075','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',1,'2026-08-19 22:00:07'),(1611,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1007','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-16 18:15:07'),(1612,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0075','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-16 19:00:07'),(1613,'BD-2000-0075','DOC-1007','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-16 19:45:07'),(1614,'DOC-1007','BD-2000-0075','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',0,'2026-08-16 20:30:07'),(1615,'BD-2000-0076','DOC-1006','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-21 18:16:07'),(1616,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0076','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-21 19:01:07'),(1617,'BD-2000-0076','DOC-1006','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-21 19:46:07'),(1618,'DOC-1006','BD-2000-0076','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you