pcoming clinic review?',1,'2026-08-14 20:07:07'),(2072,'DOC-1010','BD-2000-0097','Yes, please complete an HbA1c and serum creatinine test next week, then upload the PDF report directly to your xMED vault.',1,'2026-08-14 20:52:07'),(2073,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1010','Will do Doctor, uploaded last month’s lipid panel as well.',1,'2026-08-14 21:37:07'),(2074,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1011','Hello Doctor, I developed a sudden fever of 102°F yesterday with retro-orbital eye pain and severe body ache. Could this be dengue?',1,'2026-08-24 18:37:07'),(2075,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0097','Given seasonal trends, do NOT take any Ibuprofen or Aspirin. Take only Paracetamol 500mg up to every 6 hours and drink plenty of ORS and coconut water.',1,'2026-08-24 19:22:07'),(2076,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1011','Should I get a Complete Blood Count (CBC) and Dengue NS1 antigen test done today?',1,'2026-08-24 20:07:07'),(2077,'DOC-1011','BD-2000-0097','Yes, get a CBC and NS1 antigen test today. If platelets drop below 100,000 or you notice severe abdominal pain, proceed to the hospital emergency triage.',1,'2026-08-24 20:52:07'),(2078,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1012','Dr. Kabir, I have severe burning in my upper chest at night, despite taking Omeprazole 20mg daily.',1,'2026-08-21 18:37:07'),(2079,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0097','Make sure you take Omeprazole 30 minutes before breakfast on an empty stomach. Avoid spicy dinners and do not lie flat within 2 hours of eating.',1,'2026-08-21 19:22:07'),(2080,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1012','Can I take a chewable antacid if nighttime burning wakes me up?',1,'2026-08-21 20:07:07'),(2081,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0097','Yes, an aluminum-magnesium hydroxide chewable antacid can be taken for breakthrough nocturnal acidity.',1,'2026-08-21 20:52:07'),(2082,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1012','Thank you Doctor, adjusting my meal schedule tonight.',1,'2026-08-21 21:37:07'),(2083,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0097','You are welcome. Keep a symptom diary for the next 7 days.',0,'2026-08-21 22:22:07'),(2084,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1013','Doctor, my child has been coughing persistently at night and has a faint wheezing sound during running.',1,'2026-08-18 18:37:07'),(2085,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0097','This suggests reactive airway bronchospasm. Please administer the Salbutamol 100mcg inhaler with a spacer: 2 puffs as directed.',1,'2026-08-18 19:22:07'),(2086,'BD-2000-0097','DOC-1013','How frequently can we repeat the inhaler puffs if coughing persists?',1,'2026-08-18 20:07:07'),(2087,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0097','You can repeat 2 puffs after 20 minutes once. If chest indrawing or breathlessness appears, visit our emergency center immediately.',1,'2026-08-18 20:52:07'),(2088,'BD-2000-0098','DOC-1012','Hello Doctor, the red itchy rash on my forearms has flared up after using synthetic laundry powder.',1,'2026-08-23 18:38:07'),(2089,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0098','Apply the Hydrocortisone cream thinly twice daily for 5 days only, followed by liberal amounts of plain petroleum jelly.',1,'2026-08-23 19:23:07'),(2090,'BD-2000-0098','DOC-1012','Can I take an antihistamine like Cetirizine 10mg at night for the itching?',1,'2026-08-23 20:08:07'),(2091,'DOC-1012','BD-2000-0098','Yes, Cetirizine 10mg at bedtime will relieve nighttime itching and help you rest without scratching.',1,'2026-08-23 20:53:07'),(2092,'BD-2000-0098','DOC-1013','Good afternoon Doctor, my abdominal surgical incision looks slightly pink, but there is no fever or pus.',1,'2026-08-20 18:38:07'),(2093,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0098','Mild pink erythema is normal during surgical wound remodeling. Keep the area completely dry and clean with sterile dressing.',1,'2026-08-20 19:23:07'),(2094,'BD-2000-0098','DOC-1013','When should I visit the outpatient clinic for suture removal?',1,'2026-08-20 20:08:07'),(2095,'DOC-1013','BD-2000-0098','Please visit the surgical OPD this Thursday between 9 AM and 1 PM for stitch removal and scar assessment.',1,'2026-08-20 20:53:07'),(2096,'BD-2000-0098','DOC-1014','Doctor, my fasting lipid profile shows LDL 155 m